          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 7,
          "text_preview": "1. Introduction: The Kerala Model of Financial"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e23",
          "sequence_order": 23,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "low_content"
          ],
          "token_count": 1,
          "text_preview": "Devolution"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e24",
          "sequence_order": 24,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "Financial autonomy is the most critical determinant of the functional efficacy of Local"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e25",
          "sequence_order": 25,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 10,
          "text_preview": "Self Government Institutions (LSGIs). The mere transfer of subjects without"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e26",
          "sequence_order": 26,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 10,
          "text_preview": "commensurate financial resources renders local governance ineffective. The state of"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e27",
          "sequence_order": 27,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 11,
          "text_preview": "Kerala recognized this early in its decentralization journey, adopting what scholars"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e28",
          "sequence_order": 28,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 12,
          "text_preview": "term a \"big-bang\" approach to devolution during the historical People's Plan Campaign"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e29",
          "sequence_order": 29,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "low_content"
          ],
          "token_count": 2,
          "text_preview": "in 1996."
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e30",
          "sequence_order": 30,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 12,
          "text_preview": "Unlike many Indian states where local bodies operate as mere implementing agencies"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e31",
          "sequence_order": 31,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "for centralized schemes, reliant entirely on tied grants, Kerala structured its LSGIs as"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e32",
          "sequence_order": 32,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 10,
          "text_preview": "autonomous democratic institutions. The hallmark of Kerala’s fiscal decentralization is"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e33",
          "sequence_order": 33,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 12,
          "text_preview": "the unconditional transfer of approximately 30-35% of the state’s annual plan outlay"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e34",
          "sequence_order": 34,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 11,
          "text_preview": "directly to the local bodies. This massive financial devolution empowers local"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e35",
          "sequence_order": 35,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 9,
          "text_preview": "governments—Grama, Block, and District Panchayats, along with Municipalities and"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e36",
          "sequence_order": 36,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 8,
          "text_preview": "Corporations—to independently formulate and execute developmental projects that"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e37",
          "sequence_order": 37,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 9,
          "text_preview": "cater directly to the localized needs of their constituents."
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e38",
          "sequence_order": 38,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "The financial architecture of Kerala's LSGIs is characterized by a carefully balanced mix"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e39",
          "sequence_order": 39,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 11,
          "text_preview": "of Own Source Revenues (OSR), systematic formula-based transfers from the State"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e40",
          "sequence_order": 40,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 10,
          "text_preview": "Government, and grants from the Union Government. This extensive document"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e41",
          "sequence_order": 41,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "provides an in-depth analysis of these financial streams, the rules governing them, the"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e42",
          "sequence_order": 42,
          "page_number": 3,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 12,
          "text_preview": "budgeting process, and the mechanisms of accountability that ensure these funds are"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p3_e43",
