        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e62",
          "sequence_order": 62,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 16,
          "text_preview": "The ability of an LSGI to mobilize its own resources is a critical indicator of its"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e63",
          "sequence_order": 63,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 9,
          "text_preview": "institutional capacity. While urban bodies (Municipalities and Corporations) generally"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e64",
          "sequence_order": 64,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 12,
          "text_preview": "have robust OSRs, Grama Panchayats in Kerala also actively utilize their taxation"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e65",
          "sequence_order": 65,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "low_content"
          ],
          "token_count": 1,
          "text_preview": "powers."
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e66",
          "sequence_order": 66,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "low_content"
          ],
          "token_count": 2,
          "text_preview": "Tax Revenues"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e67",
          "sequence_order": 67,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 14,
          "text_preview": "The Kerala Panchayat Raj Act and Kerala Municipality Act empower local bodies to levy"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e68",
          "sequence_order": 68,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 9,
          "text_preview": "several compulsory and optional taxes. The major taxes include:"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e69",
          "sequence_order": 69,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 6,
          "text_preview": "1. Property Tax (The Fiscal Anchor)"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e70",
          "sequence_order": 70,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 15,
          "text_preview": "Property tax is the most significant source of own revenue for all tiers of LSGIs,"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e71",
          "sequence_order": 71,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 11,
          "text_preview": "particularly urban bodies. In Kerala, the assessment of property tax transitioned"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e72",
          "sequence_order": 72,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "from the archaic Annual Rental Value (ARV) method to the more objective Plinth"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e73",
          "sequence_order": 73,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "low_content"
          ],
          "token_count": 2,
          "text_preview": "Area-based System."
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e74",
          "sequence_order": 74,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "Calculation: The tax is calculated based on the plinth area of the building,"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e75",
          "sequence_order": 75,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "multiplied by a basic tax rate determined by the local body. The formula"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e76",
          "sequence_order": 76,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "incorporates weightages for the type of roof, the age of the building, the"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e77",
          "sequence_order": 77,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 9,
          "text_preview": "location (proximity to roads, markets), and the usage (residential,"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e78",
          "sequence_order": 78,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "low_content"
          ],
          "token_count": 2,
          "text_preview": "commercial, industrial)."
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e79",
          "sequence_order": 79,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "Equation: PT = Area × Basic Rate × (Wlocation + Wusage + Wstructure)"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "112_p6_e80",
          "sequence_order": 80,
          "page_number": 6,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
